              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Halqa have a hand weapon, composite bow and shield. Skirmishers. Nomad Cavalry. May have thrusting spear (+3). May have light armour (+1) or heavy armour (+2), in which case they become Open Order, Eastern Shock Cavalry with Feigned Flight. May instead be taken dismounted (-17) as Open Order and Riding Horses. They may then have halberd (+2).</characteristic>
